<#= mf.Heading(thisModHumanName) #>

<#= thisModHumanName #> is a Valheim mod that lets you select a portal's destination from a list. 

<#= mf.Image($"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{thisModGitHubRepo}/main/images/controller.gif", height: 180) #>

<#= mf.Heading("Where to download") #>

Install from <#= mf.Link("Thunderstore", urlThisModThunderstore) #>, or download the latest release from the <#= mf.Link("GitHub releases page", urlThisModGitHubReleases) #>.
